ndpoint column is on the allowlist and the claim is approved, source-declared, or explicitly include_unreviewed. Containment and query-log counts are never copied. Name match and type compatibility are included only when both ends allow global statistics.\n\n## order_customer_fk\n\n`shop.order_doc.customer_id` -> `shop.customer.customer_id`\ncardinality: `many_to_one`\njoin: `left`\nProvenance: declared_fk (source-declared, not a grant).\n"},{"bytes":579,"path":"tables/shop.customer.md","sha256":"e93b10dd67d86a628d70f585dbfbc9ec86b15a6bf379c5b87fcaebed52343622","text":"# shop.customer — customer\n\ntier: `raw`\nsource label: shop.customer\nprimary key: `customer_id`\n\nRow security: none. This compiler did not query the database.\nEstimated row count is omitted.\n\n| column | label | type | semantic | pii | notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `customer_id` | customer_id | int8 | identifier | none | status draft |\n| `display_name` | display_name | text | person_name | personal | Samples are omitted because pii is personal. status draft |\n\n## relationships\n\n- `order_customer_fk` shop.order_doc.customer_id -> shop.customer.customer_id\n"},{"bytes":588,"path":"tables/shop.order_doc.md","sha256":"3da95d44682749c145400500230b287ba77b698fe8da0eebddf15b645b3f6828","text":"# shop.order_doc — order_doc\n\ntier: `raw`\nsource label: shop.order_doc\nprimary key: `order_id`\n\nRow security: none. This compiler did not query the database.\nEstimated row count is omitted.\n\n| column | label | type | semantic | pii | notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `order_id` | order_id | int8 | identifier | none | status draft |\n| `customer_id` | customer_id | int8 | foreign_key | none | status draft |\n| `posted` | posted | bool | boolean_flag | none | status draft |\n\n## relationships\n\n- `order_customer_fk` shop.order_doc.customer_id -> shop.customer.customer_id\n"}],"manifest_sha256":"c29a680d093f6b3dbfc771e1438d6e3d71696e230c91d045f93db0ca2619ecf9","pa